WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:07.006
- WHOA.

00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:08.107
[laughs]

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.275
HI.

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:11.944
THAT WASN'T--
EXPECTED TO SEE YOU

00:00:11.977 --> 00:00:14.213
ALL UNDULATIN' UP HERE.

00:00:14.246 --> 00:00:15.214
UH, HI.

00:00:15.247 --> 00:00:17.350
I JUST PUT MY JACKET
ON THE BED

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:18.985
WHEN I FIRST CAME
TO THE PARTY,

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:21.254
BUT I DIDN'T REALIZE
THAT THE PARTY

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:22.722
MADE ITS WAY
UP HERE.

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:24.123
BUT I'LL GET
THAT NOW.

00:00:24.156 --> 00:00:25.792
I WILL, IF YOU--

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:28.828
CAROL, I DON'T KNOW
IF YOU'RE IN THERE SOMEWHERE,

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:30.563
BUT WHEREVER YOU ARE,

00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:32.165
THANK YOU
FOR THE INVITATION.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.366
I REALLY ENJOYED MYSELF.

00:00:33.399 --> 00:00:34.967
I'LL SEE YOU
AT WORK TOMORROW.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.136
OKAY, HEY, SIR, I THINK
I SEE MY JACKET.

00:00:37.169 --> 00:00:39.572
I THINK--I THINK YOUR ARM
IS IN THE SLEEVE, ACTUALLY.

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:40.940
I'LL GRAB--
THAT'S NOT MY JACKET,

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:42.508
AND THAT'S
NOT YOUR ARM.

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:45.078
IT'S NOT YOUR ARM.
WHITE PEOPLE ARE CRAZY.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:48.047
WHITE PEOPLE ARE CRAZY.
JUST LOOKIN' FOR A JACKET.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.650
SIR, OKAY, YES,
VERY NICE MUSTACHE.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.318
I'VE NEVER SEEN ONE
ABOVE THE NOSE.

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:54.554
THAT'S INTERESTING.
THAT'S NOT YOUR NOSE.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:56.956
OKAY, SORRY
TO DISTURB YOU, SIR.

00:00:56.989 --> 00:00:58.191
JUST LOOKIN' FOR
A JACKET,

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.393
JUST A ORDINARY MAN
LOOKIN' FOR A JACKET.

00:01:00.426 --> 00:01:01.527
YOU WANNA SAY SOMETHING
TO ME, SIR?

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:02.595
ARE YOU TRY--
OH, WAIT A MINUTE.

00:01:02.628 --> 00:01:05.031
MM-MM.
NO, THANK YOU VERY MUCH, SIR.

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:06.599
IT TASTED A LITTLE BIT
LIKE SALTY BUTT HOLE,

00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:07.900
BUT THAT'S OKAY.

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:10.436
IT'S TWEED,
THE JACKET I'M TALKING ABOUT,

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:12.238
AND IT'S GOT LEATHER PATCHES
ON IT.

00:01:12.271 --> 00:01:13.573
JUST--OH, MAYBE
THIS IS IT.

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:15.942
THANK YOU, FOUND IT, AND--
NOPE, THAT'S NOT IT,

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:17.343
BUT CONGRATULATIONS, MA'AM.

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:20.279
YOU ARE DOING GREAT
WITH WHAT GOD GAVE YOU.

00:01:20.312 --> 00:01:22.515
NOPE, DON'T LOOK AT ME
IN THE EYES, MA'AM.

00:01:22.548 --> 00:01:24.417
I DON'T WANT YOU
TO STEAL MY SOUL.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.419
HI, LADIES.
VERY NICE TO MEET YOU.

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:27.987
AND, SIR,
YES, I DO SEE YOU TOO.

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:30.923
OKAY, YES.
WHITE PEOPLE ARE CRAZY.

00:01:30.956 --> 00:01:33.559
OH, NO, I'M--I'M OKAY.
I REALLY AM.

00:01:33.592 --> 00:01:36.696
I'M ALREADY SEEING
A-A GROUP OF PEOPLE,

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.097
AND WE'RE
TAKING IT SLOWLY.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:39.198
WE ARE
TAKING IT SLOWLY.

00:01:39.231 --> 00:01:40.399
IT'S A CHURCH.

00:01:40.432 --> 00:01:42.368
MAYBE SOME OF Y'ALL
WOULD BE INTERESTED

00:01:42.401 --> 00:01:43.369
IN LOOKING INTO THAT.

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:45.938
NOT MINE,
BUT ONE SOMEWHERE,

00:01:45.971 --> 00:01:48.274
IF THAT'S--
OKAY, THANK YOU, MA'AM, FOR--

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:49.675
THERE IT IS.
I FOUND IT.

00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:51.544
FOUND THE JACKET.
IT'S RIGHT HERE.

00:01:51.577 --> 00:01:52.778
I'MA PULL IT,
AND I BELIEVE

00:01:52.811 --> 00:01:55.515
IT MIGHT BE LOST SOMEWHERE
WITHIN YOU.

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:56.883
I'M JUST GUESSING
BECAUSE THAT

00:01:56.916 --> 00:02:00.219
IS JUST A LITTLE BIT
OF RESISTANCE.

00:02:00.252 --> 00:02:01.420
ALL RIGHT,
THERE WE GO.

00:02:01.453 --> 00:02:04.290
AND YOU KNOW WHAT?
THAT IS GOING TO BE YOURS.

00:02:04.323 --> 00:02:06.025
KEEP IT, THANK YOU.
COVER YOURSELVES UP.

00:02:06.058 --> 00:02:07.627
CAROL, IF YOU'RE
IN THERE,

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:08.928
I'LL SEE YOU
AT THE OFFICE TOMORROW.

00:02:08.961 --> 00:02:11.230
JUST BRING THE BOWL.
YOU CAN FINISH THE EGG SALAD.

00:02:11.263 --> 00:02:12.996
MY GOD,
WHITE PEOPLE CRAZY.

